THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

The notice above covers Vulpecula Games' own work only. The following are not
ours and keep their own terms, which take precedence for that material:

  - Golf-course geometry (course-maps.json, play-geom/, and the baked
    COURSE_GEOM data) is derived from OpenStreetMap, (c) OpenStreetMap
    contributors, and is available under the Open Database License (ODbL)
    1.0: https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright. That data stays ODbL and
    must keep its attribution.

  - Star catalogues (star-catalog.json, star-catalog-deep.json, and the
    embedded STAR_FIGURES seed) are derived from the HYG Database, which is in
    the public domain: https://www.astronexus.com/hyg

  - Night-sky imagery (night-heroes/, night-photos/) was generated with Black
    Forest Labs' FLUX models and is subject to Black Forest Labs' output and
    usage terms.

  - The fonts in fonts/ (DM Mono and Syne) are licensed under the SIL Open
    Font License 1.1. Their copyright notices and the licence text ship
    beside them: fonts/OFL-DMMono.txt and fonts/OFL-Syne.txt.

  - The world outline used by the aurora globe (world-land.json) is derived
    from Natural Earth, which is in the public domain.

  - Live weather and sky data are fetched at runtime from Open-Meteo,
    sunrisesunset.io, NOAA SWPC and wheretheiss.at, under each provider's terms.
